* The EU EOM report pushback is now a recurring pattern — this is the third consecutive day of government-aligned responses, following Chief Government Spokesperson Elvis Nkandu's characterisation of the report as "flawed" and "out-rightly incorrect." Watch for whether the EU mission responds publicly.

