* Airtel Zambia formally committed support to the Grow Zambia Agenda in the presence of Technology and Science Minister Felix Mutati. Airtel has been visible in this space before, with a Bundle Bonanza launch a week ago and a national tree planting exercise a month ago — a pattern of corporate alignment with government messaging worth tracking.

